<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: The man who walked away
</h4>

<p>
Beyond the wow:<br />
<br />
Reads like a movie. You can see the scene. "Drip coffee, subway tokens, morning."<br />
<br />
And then: "A woman is trapped in a burning car."<br />
<br />
The sound might be turned off for the second part of this scene.<br />
<br />
Then the silence ends with the paper hitting the porch: " ... the worst aviation disaster of all time. "
</p>
